/-! # The refined BMV lower bound at bidegree (10,4)

The exact certificate checks the ordered-word sum minus 1001 times the cyclic comparator with gaps
(3,2,3,2). The 1001 words have 73 cyclic classes, and the comparator's
class contains seven words.

The matrices below are 720 times the three expanded Gram matrices C K Cᵀ.
Each factor starts from the exact unit-lower-triangular LDLᵀ decomposition
of K, with the columns of C L rescaled to primitive integers. The
corresponding diagonal weights absorb the scaling and zero padding.
-/

